---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const ledger = [
  { k: 'Thirty-four years', v: 'in the uniform of the United States Army' },
  { k: 'Major General', v: 'a two-star general officer, retired' },
  { k: 'Ranger, Airborne', v: 'combat-decorated for service under fire' },
  { k: 'Virginia', v: 'born, raised, and rooted in the Commonwealth' },
];
---

<section class="rec section" id="record">
  <div class="wrap-wide rec__grid">
    <figure class="rec__media rise">
      <img
        src={`${base}img/ceremony.jpg`}
        alt="Bert Mizusawa addressing servicemembers at a military ceremony"
        width="1400" height="1750" loading="lazy"
      />
      <figcaption>Addressing servicemembers &middot; in command</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="rec__body">
      <h2 class="display rec__title rise">A record<br />you can read.</h2>
      <div class="rec__prose rise" data-d="1">
        <p>
          Bert Mizusawa did not come up through politics. He came up through
          service &mdash; rising from a young officer to Major General across
          three decades, leading soldiers where the stakes were measured in lives,
          not poll numbers.
        </p>
        <p>
          He brings that same standard to Virginia: results over rhetoric,
          accountability over applause, and a plain belief that the people who
          govern should answer to the people who sent them.
        </p>
      </div>

      <dl class="ledger rise" data-d="2">
        {ledger.map((row) => (
          <div class="ledger__row">
            <dt>{row.k}</dt>
            <dd>{row.v}</dd>
          </div>
        ))}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .rec { background: var(--bg); position: relative; }
  .rec__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.82fr 1.18fr;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .rec__media { margin: 0; position: relative; }
  .rec__media img {
    width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-fit: cover;
    filter: url(#v2-bronze) contrast(1.03);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line-brass);
  }
  .rec__media figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--font-ui); font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .rec__title {
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 1.4rem + 2.6vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 0.96;
  }
  .rec__prose { margin: 1.75rem 0 2.5rem; max-width: var(--measure); }
  .rec__prose p + p { margin-top: 1.1rem; }

  .ledger { display: grid; }
  .ledger__row {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem; align-items: baseline;
    padding: 1.15rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  }
  .ledger__row:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft); }
  .ledger dt {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-stretch: 112%;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.92rem + 0.4vw, 1.22rem);
    color: var(--brass-bright);
  }
  .ledger dd { color: var(--bone-dim); font-size: 1.02rem; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .rec__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .rec__media { max-width: 440px; }
    .ledger__row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.3rem; }
  }
</style>
